{
  "id": "gamma",
  "term": "gamma",
  "definition": "In this packet, gamma refers to gamma-band brain activity measured with EEG, including its strength and synchronisation across brain areas. It is described as a neural signal linked to swallowing, with reduced activity and connectivity seen in post-stroke dysphagia and some excessive connectivity associated with more severe swallowing problems.",
